{7}{I want to become an adventurer like yourself, to travel Arcanum, and earn enough gold to study electricity, perhaps, (she looks around and drops her voice as if telling you a deep, dark secret) even become a professor in the field.}{I want to become an adventurer like yourself, to travel Arcanum, and earn enough gold to study electricity, perhaps, (she looks around and drops her voice as if telling you a deep, dark secret) even become a professor in the field.}{}{}{}{}
{8}{Why did you whisper just then ?}{}{1}{}{9}{}
{9}{Ever since I was a little girl, I have wanted to study electricity. (She looks down at her feet.) My playmates teased me unmercifully about it. They said I was putting on airs, that a girl could never become a professor, and that I thought I was too good for Shrouded Hills. (She looks back into your eyes) then they would beat me up}{Ever since I was a little girl, I have wanted to study electricity. (She looks down at her feet.) My playmates teased me unmercifully about it. They said I was putting on airs, that a girl could never become a professor, and that I thought I was too good for Shrouded Hills. (She looks back into your eyes) then they would beat me up}{}{}{}{}
